<section id="project">

<div class="title">

<div class="label">THE PROJECT</div>

<h2>Designing a practical approach to fire safety.</h2>

<p>

Silico Guard explores silicone-based fire blanket concepts designed around

fire response, protection and practical usability.

</p>

</div>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">

<div class="label">PROTOTYPE 01</div>

<h3>Silicone Fire Blanket</h3>

<p>

A flexible silicone-based blanket concept designed to help isolate a fire

from oxygen and provide an additional fire-response option.

</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="label">PROTOTYPE 02</div>

<h3>Cooling Gel Blanket</h3>

<p>

A second concept combining the blanket design with a cooling gel layer

intended to reduce heat sensation and support personal protection.

</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="design" class="development">

<div class="title">

<div class="label">DESIGN & DEVELOPMENT</div>

<h2>From concept to physical prototype.</h2>

<p>

The project combined safety-focused thinking, 3D modelling and practical

demonstration.

</p>

</div>

<div class="steps">

<div class="step">

<div class="step-number">01</div>

<h3>Concept</h3>

<p>Developing the fire safety concept around fire isolation and practical response.</p>

</div>

<div class="step">

<div class="step-number">02</div>

<h3>3D Design</h3>

<p>Creating product concepts and visual models using Blender.</p>

</div>

<div class="step">

<div class="step-number">03</div>

<h3>Prototype</h3>

<p>Developing physical prototypes and conducting a practical demonstration.</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

