<section class="safety">

<div class="title">

<div class="label">SAFETY DURING DEMONSTRATION</div>

<h2>Safety remained a priority during practical testing.</h2>

</div>

<div class="safety-box">

<strong>Practical Demonstration Safety Measures</strong>

<p>

A formal, documented risk assessment was not conducted for this project.

However, safety precautions were taken during the practical demonstration,

including having a fire extinguisher on standby along with other precautionary

and backup measures in place to respond to an emergency during the test.

</p>

</div>

</section>

